{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401994-tell-me-about-your-gunstar-characters-1","id":1401994,"title":"Tell me about your Gunstar characters!!!1!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-09T17:28:59-07:00","id":1401994,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon6.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Tell me about your Gunstar characters!!!1!","content":"Tell me about the awesome Characters you made for your <i>Gunstar </i>games!<br /> <br /> Because... fun! <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-09T18:19:20-07:00","id":1401998,"title":"","content":"If there isn't a Solar Captain Kirk as the captain of a scouting ship for the Gunstar, then what's the point?<br /> <br /> But would Spock be a Sidereal or Alchemical?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-09T23:31:40-07:00","id":1402018,"title":"","content":"Spock would be a Sidereal. (Not sure about Caste.)<br /> <br /> Data &amp; <i>7 of 9</i> would be the Alchemicals. Why choose only 1 generation?<br /> <br /> I'm thinking Bones &amp; Scottie would both be Solars. Am I wrong?<br /> <br /> __________________________________________________ ________<br /> <br /> <br /> Does everyone else lack pride in their PC's &amp; NPC's they made for Gunstar?<br /> <br /> One of the best Shards for Exalted, &amp; no one made something that amused them???<br /> <br /> Boast loud! Boast proud!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T00:58:54-07:00","id":1402022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401994-tell-me-about-your-gunstar-characters-1?p=1402018#post1402018\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm thinking Bones\u2026 would\u2026 be Solars. Am I wrong?</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno, he\u2019s a doctor, not a miracle worker. <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> In all honesty, never played Gunstar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T06:47:37-07:00","id":1402060,"title":"","content":"We played a short Gunstar game, back in the day. My memory's a bit fuzzy, so bear with me.<br /> <br /> Tycho (he had a longer name, but that's all I remember) was a Chosen of Journeys who played by his own rules. He had a robot arm, a laser gun, and devil-may-care attitude. His main fighting style was Crystal Chameleon, backed up by the aforementioned laser gun. Tycho was convinced that there was a quicker path back to the Core, so he scouted out routes in his banged-up starship with the help of his spirit familiar, Beetlebug (Beetlebug was not much help as he was always scavenging &quot;inessential&quot; parts from the ship to barter for commodities; his big hustle was an attempt to corner the root vegetable trade from the various planets the Gunstar plundered). Tycho got chewed out by Admiral Leviathan on several occasions for being a loose cannon, but he kept Tycho on the force because he got results, dammit.<br /> <br /> The other player character was a Fire Aspect whose name I can't remember. He was a fighter pilot and a damn good one, though that Scarlet Empress stole all his glory. Every attempt to one-up her was unsuccessful. He had a huge family -- at least a dozen kids -- and it was tough balancing his duty to the Deliberative with his obligations as a family man. Corrupted Alchemical infiltrators kept putting his family in peril, taking hostages and hijacking the Gunstar's PA system to issue grandiose threats. He had a glorious set of specialties, all of them fire-related puns (Archery: Fire away; Sail: Afterburners; Presence: Fire them up!). He tended to have bad luck in pretty much every situation except for in the cockpit -- there, he was untouchable.<br /> <br /> It's a fantastic setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1453-henry","name":"Henry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T07:06:12-07:00","id":1402064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401994-tell-me-about-your-gunstar-characters-1?p=1402022#post1402022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dunno, he\u2019s a doctor, not a miracle worker.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>LOL! (Applauds)<br /> <br /> Brilliant.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Henry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401994-tell-me-about-your-gunstar-characters-1?p=1402060#post1402060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tycho (he had a longer name, but that's all I remember) was a Chosen of Journeys who played by his own rules. He had a robot arm, a laser gun, and devil-may-care attitude. His main fighting style was Crystal Chameleon, backed up by the aforementioned laser gun...</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Henry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401994-tell-me-about-your-gunstar-characters-1?p=1402060#post1402060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...Tycho got chewed out by Admiral Leviathan on several occasions for being a loose cannon, but he kept Tycho on the force because he got results, dammit.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Henry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401994-tell-me-about-your-gunstar-characters-1?p=1402060#post1402060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The other player character was a Fire Aspect whose name I can't remember...</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Henry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401994-tell-me-about-your-gunstar-characters-1?p=1402060#post1402060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...He had a glorious set of specialties, all of them fire-related puns (Archery: Fire away; Sail: Afterburners; Presence: Fire them up!). He tended to have bad luck in pretty much every situation except for in the cockpit -- there, he was untouchable.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fantastic. Simply fantastic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}